 "description": "Manage player characters: create (quick or step-by-step), stage to roster, import, render a sheet, set the active entity, set personality/voice, send player signals, remove, or list roster characters. Mutating actions persist to the Novel and are audited; read-only actions do not mutate state. Revert the most recent mutation with manage_history (action: undo). The personality{} object aliases description/voice/background/goals, and details{} aliases ability_scores/skills/feats/talents/equipment; a top-level value overrides its grouped alias. Use when: working with player characters. Do NOT use when: managing NPCs \u2014 use manage_npc.",
